# PyCharm / JetBrains project metadata
# Most of .idea/ is fine to commit (vcs.xml, modules.xml, *.iml, misc.xml,
# inspectionProfiles/) since it's small and not machine-specific for this repo.
# User-local/generated files (workspace state, shelved changes, caches, any
# datasource credentials) are already excluded via .idea/.gitignore.

# Diagnostic/log output produced by the scripts in this repo
*.log

